{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t觀塘翠屏北邨和沙田博康邨合共48部升降機，被發現只安裝耐火門，但沒有安裝門框組件，施工存在嚴重缺失。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有居民表示，不擔心升降機安全問題；亦有居民期望，當局披露更多資訊。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:00:30.463688+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:39:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:59.738672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:58:04.800975+00:00","content_hash":"2f926c575131a448be0f79f1d6dab7fd0bfc19e6639e7164b63bd2e86ce0310b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}